orbitra-ratvar-title = Ratvar Cult
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-repair = Repair mechanisms
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-repair-desc = Repair 50 damage on a nearby cult mechanism.
orbitra-ratvar-description = Hidden cultists build an ark aboard the station. Designed for 15-30 players.
orbitra-ratvar-role-name = Servant of Ratvar
orbitra-ratvar-objective = Convert the crew, develop the cult and defend the ark until Ratvar arrives.
orbitra-ratvar-briefing = You serve Ratvar. Type +r text in local chat to use the collective mind without a radio or tablet. Use your tablet for scriptures and on a living cuffed human on a submission sigil to convert them. Defend the ark!
orbitra-ratvar-victory = Ratvar has awakened! Cult victory.
orbitra-ratvar-defeat = Ratvar was not summoned. The cult has failed.
orbitra-ratvar-round-statistics = Unique minds converted: { $count }.
orbitra-ratvar-communication = [Ratvar's mind] { $name }: { $message }
orbitra-ratvar-communication-denied = Thought not sent. You need living cult membership, nonempty text of up to 300 characters and a two-second pause between messages.
orbitra-ratvar-ark-announcement = Ratvar's ark has activated on { $station }! Grid coordinates: { $x }, { $y }. Five minutes until summoning. Destroy the ark!
orbitra-ratvar-ark-destroyed = The ark has been destroyed. Ratvar's summoning is thwarted!
orbitra-ratvar-tablet-title = Scriptures of Ratvar
orbitra-ratvar-message-placeholder = Private cult communication…
orbitra-ratvar-message-send = Send
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-cost = Tier { $tier } · Energy: { $energy }
orbitra-ratvar-status = Energy: { $energy } · Tier: { $tier } · Converted: { $converts }
orbitra-ratvar-unavailable-busy = Finish the current scripture.
orbitra-ratvar-unavailable-tier = This scripture tier is not unlocked.
orbitra-ratvar-unavailable-energy = Not enough shared energy.
orbitra-ratvar-unavailable-obelisk = The obelisk only provides communication. Hold a tablet to recite scriptures.
orbitra-ratvar-unavailable-location = Unavailable here: check placement, the structure limit or the presence of a damaged mechanism nearby.
orbitra-ratvar-marauder-name = Ratvar's marauder
orbitra-ratvar-marauder-description = Defend the cult in a brass body. Melee combat and a temporary defensive stance.
orbitra-ratvar-marauder-rules = You are a team antagonist serving Ratvar's cult. Defend its members and ark. You cannot convert crew or build constructs.
orbitra-ratvar-instructions = Glory to Ratvar! Hold and open your tablet. Build generators and a submission sigil. Use the tablet on a living cuffed human on the sigil for a 15-second ritual. Mindshields, chaplains and incompatible roles prevent conversion. Holy water removes allegiance after 30 continuous seconds and grants two minutes of immunity. Unique converts and generated energy unlock tiers. Activate the ark after 20 minutes at tier three, with three living servants nearby and 2000 energy. Defend it for five minutes. See the tablet guide for details.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-brass = Brass
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-brass-desc = Create ten brass sheets for construction.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-conversionsigil = Submission sigil
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-conversionsigil-desc = A conversion ritual requires its target to stand on this sigil.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-generator = Generator
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-generator-desc = Generates shared energy. Up to three generators.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-armor = Brass armor
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-armor-desc = Create a protective cuirass.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-helmet = Brass helmet
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-helmet-desc = Create a protective helmet.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-spear = Ratvarian spear
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-spear-desc = Create a melee spear.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-shield = Brass shield
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-shield-desc = Create a shield.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-slowingsigil = Transgression sigil
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-slowingsigil-desc = Slows enemies stepping onto the sigil.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-obelisk = Communication obelisk
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-obelisk-desc = Build a cult obelisk.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-turret = Ocular warden
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-turret-desc = A defensive turret with limited ammunition.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-marauder = Marauder shell
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-marauder-desc = A voluntary ghost role shell. Up to two living shells.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-ark = Ark of Ratvar
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-ark-desc = One ark on the main station. Activation requires tier three and three servants.
orbitra-ratvar-admin-make = Make Ratvar cultist
orbitra-ratvar-admin-description = Grant the role and equipment to a living player-controlled human without another antagonist role or a mindshield. Creates the cult if needed; does not require 15 players. Unavailable after the cult ends.
